<tr><td class="lf-qn">20</td><td>4098 + 327 = ？（小心：個位進位！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">21</td><td>小明計 2478+3659=5,037，小華話係 6,137。點判斷邊個啱？（用Estimation！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌳 Challenge Tier（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
